{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07480","headline":"郧上送韦司士归上都旧业 · 刘长卿","name":"郧上送韦司士归上都旧业","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"前朝旧业想遗尘，今日他乡独尔身。\n郧地国除爲过客，杜陵家在有何人。\n苍苔白露生三径，古木寒蝉满四邻。\n西去茫茫问归路，关河渐近泪盈巾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07480.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07480","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}